[0.516, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 1. A cluster\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.924, "o", "   k3d-kubemend-demo-agent-0  Ready\r\n   k3d-kubemend-demo-server-0  Ready\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 2. A git repository holding the desired state\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.836, "o", "   Waiting for deployment \"checkout\" rollout to finish: 0 out of 2 new replicas have been updated...\r\n"]
[0.288, "o", "   Waiting for deployment \"checkout\" rollout to finish: 0 of 2 updated replicas are available...\r\n"]
[13.566, "o", "   Waiting for deployment \"checkout\" rollout to finish: 1 of 2 updated replicas are available...\r\n"]
[9.742, "o", "   deployment \"checkout\" successfully rolled out\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 3. A release goes out, and it is wrong\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.310, "o", "\u001b[2m   waiting for the cluster to notice...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.917, "o", "   checkout-6d78fb9788-9dbd2  ImagePullBackOff\r\n   checkout-7bbdcbc9b7-crztm  Running\r\n   checkout-7bbdcbc9b7-d2d8f  Running\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 4. kubemend reads the cluster (read-only)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.464, "o", "    kubemend   1 finding(s), 1 incident(s), policy 'conservative'\r\n    critical  payments/deployment/checkout       image_pull\r\n              cannot pull image nginx:1.27-alpine-typo for checkout-6d78fb9788-9dbd2\r\n    remediation   one plan per incident, gated independently\r\n      ✓ APPLY    payments/deployment/checkout\r\n          rollback payments/deployment/checkout (revision: 2 -> 1)\r\n          ↳ image_pull: cannot pull image nginx:1.27-alpine-typo for checkout-6d78fb9788-9dbd2\r\n          undo: rollback payments/deployment/checkout (revision: 1 -> 2)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 5. kubemend writes the fix, then watches to see whether it worked\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[29.094, "o", "    kubemend remediate   1 incident(s), policy 'conservative', repo kubemend-gitops\r\n      ✓ APPLY    payments/deployment/checkout\r\n          restored clusters/prod/checkout.yaml to 4befcbad\r\n          commit cbb07a7c on main\r\n          no git remote; commit is local only\r\n          -          image: nginx:1.27-alpine-typo   # known good\r\n          +          image: nginx:1.27-alpine   # known good\r\n          watching for recovery...\r\n          recovered after 27s\r\n    1 commit(s) written.\r\n"]
[0.023, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 6. The commit it produced\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.064, "o", "   commit cbb07a7c89f88ac0611e74fc84a27c98bd053038\r\n   Author: kubemend <kubemend@localhost>\r\n   Date:   Thu Aug 20 21:42:07 2026 -0500\r\n   \r\n       rollback payments/deployment/checkout\r\n       \r\n       Observed:\r\n         [critical] cannot pull image nginx:1.27-alpine-typo for checkout-6d78fb9788-9dbd2\r\n       \r\n       Changed:\r\n         restored clusters/prod/checkout.yaml to 4befcbad\r\n           reason: image_pull: cannot pull image nginx:1.27-alpine-typo for checkout-6d78fb9788-9dbd2\r\n       \r\n       Blast radius: 2 pod(s) across 1 workload(s).\r\n       Undo: git revert this commit.\r\n   \r\n    clusters/prod/checkout.yaml | 2 +-\r\n    1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 7. The cluster, afterwards\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.681, "o", "   deployment \"checkout\" successfully rolled out\r\n"]
[0.198, "o", "   checkout-7bbdcbc9b7-crztm  Running\r\n   checkout-7bbdcbc9b7-d2d8f  Running\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 8. Now a fix that does NOT work\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m   two bad releases in a row, so rolling back one is not enough\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.082, "o", "   checkout-598f76497b-tj528  ImagePullBackOff\r\n   checkout-7bbdcbc9b7-crztm  Running\r\n   checkout-7bbdcbc9b7-d2d8f  Running\r\n"]
[76.139, "o", "    kubemend remediate   1 incident(s), policy 'conservative', repo kubemend-gitops\r\n      ✓ APPLY    payments/deployment/checkout\r\n          restored clusters/prod/checkout.yaml to 90b0fe0f\r\n          commit e35bf187 on main\r\n          no git remote; commit is local only\r\n          -          image: nginx:1.27-broken-b   # known good\r\n          +          image: nginx:1.27-broken-a   # known good\r\n          watching for recovery...\r\n          still failing after 75s: cannot pull image nginx:1.27-broken-a for checkout-78f8f7548c-7dc82\r\n          reverted in 3317e7ab\r\n    0 commit(s) written.\r\n"]
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 9. It withdrew its own change\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.011, "o", "   3317e7a Revert \"rollback payments/deployment/checkout\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "   e35bf18 rollback payments/deployment/checkout\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "   e99333f bad release B\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m   the repository is back to the state a human last approved\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== 10. What it knows about itself\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.131, "o", "    incident log   /tmp/kubemend-demo-journal.db\r\n    2026-08-21 02:44:15  reverted      payments/deployment/checkout\r\n        cannot pull image nginx:1.27-broken-b for checkout-598f76497b-tj528\r\n    2026-08-21 02:42:34  verified      payments/deployment/checkout\r\n        cannot pull image nginx:1.27-alpine-typo for checkout-6d78fb9788-9dbd2\r\n    totals   across 2 run(s)\r\n      incidents   2\r\n      committed   2\r\n      refused     0\r\n      verified    1\r\n      revert rate 50%  (1 of 2 fixes did not hold)\r\n    keeps coming back   a rollback is not going to fix these\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "        2x  payments/checkout\r\n"]
[0.008, "o", "\u001b[2m   the revert rate above is measured from those two outcomes, not claimed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== Done\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mThe agent never called the Kubernetes API to change anything.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mIt read the cluster, committed a fix, watched, kept the one that worked,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mand reverted the one that did not.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36;1m\r\n== Tearing down\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.035, "o", "\u001b[2mcluster deleted; pass --keep to leave it running\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "x", "0"]
